==Major events==
{{spoilers}}
* {{adv|Ruby}} stops a rampaging {{p|Grumpig}}. {{adv|Sapphire}} is shocked by the revelation of his abilities as a battler.
* Sapphire asks Ruby to help her fight against [[Team Aqua]] and [[Team Magma]], but he declines.
* [[Tate and Liza]] fight [[Blaise]] on [[Mt. Pyre]]. Blaise manages to steal the [[Red Orb|Red]] and [[Blue Orb]]s.
* [[Maxie]] and [[Archie]] decide to cooperate and travel to the [[Seafloor Cavern]] together.
* [[Winona]] gives Sapphire the {{badge|Feather}}.
* Ruby participates in the Hyper Rank Pokémon Contests in a flooded [[Slateport City]].
* Ruby hurts [[Feefee]]'s feelings, and she flees.
* {{p|Kyogre}} and {{p|Groudon}} awaken.
* Sapphire finds a {{p|Relicanth}}.
* Ruby decides to help everybody, and he and Sapphire travel to the Seafloor Cavern on Relicanth.

